        {
          "id": "introduction",
          "title": "Start with what you know",
          "theory": "Many Bärndütsch sounds are ones you already know from English, and if you speak French, Spanish or Portuguese, from those too. We start with these, so you can recognise and say them in everyday words.",
          "examples": []
        },
